<title>POLAND: Celuloza Q1 net falls to PLN 5.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Celuloza Q1 net falls to PLN 5.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celuloza Swiecie SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     16.43  vs    49.86</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 17.57  vs    52.29</p>
<p>    net profit				5.50  vs    25.68</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Celuloza Swiecie SA</p>
<p>    net sales			     160.76  vs   187.65</p>
<p>    costs of sales			121.78  vs   119.96</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.07  vs     0.03</p>
<p>    income tax			     11.10  vs    22.08</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs	na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    1.73  vs    40.99</p>
<p>    financial costs			 0.65  vs    38.53</p>
<p>    investment			     25.53  vs    27.21</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
